🎯 Purpose

Template for monitoring environment conditions and device health via SNMP and ICMP.

📊 Monitored Metrics
Room Temperature (temp.room)
Device Temperature (temp.device)
Room Humidity (humidity.room)
Input Voltage (voltage.input)
Water Leak (status.inpa1)
ICMP Ping (icmpping)
ICMP Response Time (icmppingsec)
Firmware Version (system.firmware.version)

🚨 Triggers
No ICMP Response for 15m
High Room Humidity (> {$MAX.HUMIDITY})
Warning: Room Temperature (> {$TEMP.AVG}°C)
Critical: Room Temperature (> {$TEMP.CRITICAL}°C)
Water Leak Detected

🔧 Macros
{$TEMP.AVG} – warning temperature
{$TEMP.CRITICAL} – critical temperature
{$MAX.HUMIDITY} – humidity threshold

🧠 Summary
Monitors temperature, humidity, power, connectivity, and leak detection, providing early alerts for critical conditions.
